function isOwnerAccount(u){if(!u)return false;var e=(u.gmail||'').toLowerCase().trim();var r=String(u.rblxUserId||'').trim();return OWNER_CONFIG.emails.indexOf(e)!==-1||OWNER_CONFIG.robloxIds.indexOf(r)!==-1||u.isOwner===true;}
function isCoOwner(u){return u&&u.isCoOwner===true;}
function isOwnerOrCoOwner(u){return isOwnerAccount(u)||isCoOwner(u);}
function isUserAdmin(u){return u&&(isOwnerOrCoOwner(u)||u.isAdmin===true||u.role==='Admin');}
function isUserModerator(u){return u&&(isUserAdmin(u)||u.isMod===true||u.role==='Moderator');}
function isStaff(u){return isUserModerator(u)||isUserAdmin(u)||isOwnerOrCoOwner(u);}
